Z||000001||87GTZ34||08-14-2001||01:05 AM||||Actually, no Fieros came with power steering.  Rumor has it they (GM) was working on a electric version of PS.  Are you interested in adding PS to your car?||||reg||1
Z||000002||Primaris||08-14-2001||01:09 AM||||No Fiero had P/S.  If your looking to lighten the steering remove the steering damper.<P>------------------<BR>Signatures are a waste of bandwidth!||||reg||1
Z||000003||Fiero*101||08-14-2001||01:31 AM||||where is this steering damper located?<P>Fiero*101||||reg||1
Z||000004||maryjane||08-14-2001||01:50 AM||||Under front of car, connected to the steering rack & pinion assy is a small shock absorber looking cylinder. It Bolts on. Easy to remove. You may feel kickbacks thru the steering wheel with it off. Mine stays on.||||reg||1
Z||000005||MrPBody||08-14-2001||07:26 AM||||Removing the steering damper will lighten transient steering but result in kickback on rough pavement, particularly under braking.  To lighten further and reduce kickback, install Grand Am alloy wheels on front.<P>Sorry, gotta go -- daughter's crying.<BR>||||reg||1
Z||000006||Kasdan||08-14-2001||09:21 AM||||I have power steering damnit!  *will post pictures when hes not broke and can develop them*||||reg||1
Z||000007||MinnGreenGT||08-14-2001||11:11 AM||||Someone at the Dells Run this year had a 3800 with power steering.  He took the assembly from a Merkur XR4Ti (I Think).  Said it bolted right in- was running the Power Steering pump on the 3800!  Cool.||||reg||1
Z||000008||btoth||08-14-2001||04:52 PM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by MinnGreenGT:<BR><B>Someone at the Dells Run this year had a 3800 with power steering.  He took the assembly from a Merkur XR4Ti (I Think).  Said it bolted right in- was running the Power Steering pump on the 3800!  Cool.</B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>That is pretty cool.  But, IMO, the manual steering is SO much more fun when driving through the turns.  Not so much for parallel parking though.  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif">||||reg||1
