Z||000011||grinthock||08-14-2001||06:44 PM||||I have driven cars with power steering, I do'nt feel like I have CONTROL of the car, too much crap between my hands and the road...  You are virtually DISCONNECTED from the steering rack, I like it the way it is...   I hate vehicles you can drive with your pinky, can't feel road movement.<P>(Quoted from an AVRO Arrow Pilot)<BR>"I want to FEEL wing lift and stress otherwise I will twist a wing off!  You can't have it all done by machine!"||||reg||1
